page('/contact/','Contact James Nowlin | Columbia SC Real Estate','Call or text James Nowlin at (803) 949-0229 or email office@jamesnowlinrealtor.com to discuss buying or selling in the Columbia metro area.',intro('LET’S TALK ABOUT WHAT’S NEXT','Every move starts<br>with a conversation.','Buying, selling, or just getting your bearings? Reach James directly.')+'''<section class="wrap split section topzero"><div class="contactdetails"><p class="eyebrow">JAMES NOWLIN / REALTY ONE GROUP RESIDE</p><a class="bigphone" href="tel:+18039490229">(803) 949-0229</a><a href="mailto:office@jamesnowlinrealtor.com">office@jamesnowlinrealtor.com</a><p>Brokerage office<br>5300-B Sunset Blvd.<br>Lexington, SC 29072</p><div class="actions">'''+btn('Call James','tel:+18039490229')+btn('Send a text','sms:+18039490229','light')+'''</div></div><form id="contactform"><h2>Tell James your plans.</h2><p class="fine">This prepares a message in your email app for you to review and send.</p><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="100"></label><label>Email address<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required></label><label>I’m interested in<select name="interest"><option>Buying a home</option><option>Selling a home</option><option>Buying and selling</option><option>Exploring my options</option></select></label><label>What do you have in mind?<textarea name="message" rows="4" maxlength="3000" required placeholder="Areas, timing, must-haves, or questions…"></textarea></label><button class="button" type="submit">Prepare email <span>↗</span></button><p id="formstatus" role="status" class="fine"></p><p class="fine">No information is stored by this form. <a href="/privacy/">Privacy details</a></p></form></section>''')
page('/privacy/','Privacy | James Nowlin Real Estate','How the James Nowlin website handles contact information and links to external services.',intro('WEBSITE INFORMATION','Privacy, plainly.','This website is designed to help you explore and contact James.')+'<section class="wrap narrow section topzero"><h2>Contact form</h2><p>The contact form opens your email application with a draft. It does not submit information to this website or store it in a website database. Your email provider processes any message you choose to send. You can also contact James by phone or text.</p><h2>Moving checklist</h2><p>The optional resource-page checklist stores checked items in your browser’s local storage. No checklist data is sent to James. Use “Clear checked items” on the resources page to reset your progress.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Brokerage search, home-value tools, social media, and other linked sites have their own privacy policies. This site does not add advertising trackers or analytics scripts. Hosting providers may process standard technical access data to operate and secure the website.</p><h2>Questions or accessibility help</h2><p>Contact office@jamesnowlinrealtor.com or (803) 949-0229. If you cannot use a feature, James can help you access the information directly.</p></section>')
page('/sources/','Information & Sources | James Nowlin','Source information for James Nowlin’s profile, property history and Midlands area guides.',intro('INFORMATION & SOURCES','Grounded in real information.','Reviewed October 14, 2026.')+f'<section class="wrap narrow section topzero"><h2>Agent information</h2><p>James’s name, portrait, brokerage, contact details, office address, license number, and mortgage-finance background come from <a href="{OLD}">his brokerage website</a>. The illustrative home photograph and brokerage logo also come from that site.</p><h2>Historical property examples</h2><p>The selected addresses are attributed to James in <a href="https://www.realty.com/real-estate-agents/2640598/james_nowlin">Realty.com’s agent listing history</a>. These examples are not advertised as currently available and are not claims about a specific representation side, sale price, or sales volume.</p><h2>Area guides</h2><p>The guides provide orientation and property-review questions. Each links to an official community or visitor resource. They do not assert current market averages, school rankings, or guaranteed commute times.</p><h2>Current listings</h2><p>Use the linked brokerage search and confirm details with James. Listings, availability, and prices can change. This site does not syndicate a live MLS feed.</p></section>')
page('/resources/','Columbia & Lexington Local Resources | James Nowlin','Find official Midlands resources for property records, taxes, utilities, schools, lake permits and moving. Search 30 helpful links and use a moving checklist.',resource_body(intro,btn,faqblock),RESOURCE_FAQS)
